{"id": "EUVD-2026-93402", "enisaUuid": "5b407d4f-b617-37ab-96bc-d792cd2a2fb4", "description": "Mooncake Store master through 0.3.13.post1 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to create, steal, and falsely complete replication tasks via the coro_rpc port. Attackers can invoke CreateCopyTask, CreateMoveTask, FetchTasks, and MarkTaskToComplete with victim client UUIDs disclosed by QueryTask to hijack task queues and record replication that never occurred.", "datePublished": "2026-10-06T14:03:16", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-06T15:37:52", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/issues/4475", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/719735896c86b56fabec6cf3e825fb2ea640597a/mooncake-store/src/master_service.cpp#L12060-L12120", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake/blob/719735896c86b56fabec6cf3e825fb2ea640597a/mooncake-store/src/task_manager.cpp#L113-L135", "https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mooncake-store-through-0.3.13-post1-missing-authorization-in-replication-task-rpc"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-106039", "GHSA-vf47-333j-q4ww"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.33, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "48c41a7a-817a-3c14-9c63-5c180b6ab5ac", "product": {"name": "mooncake", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.3.13.post1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "91ee6155-bd93-3170-bcbd-3d9e59c14472", "vendor": {"name": "kvcache-ai"}}], "isExploited": false}